  "definition": "A retail business that sells its products via a website, app or third-party marketplace rather than (or in addition to) a physical store."
 },
 {
  "term": "passing trade",
  "definition": "Sales made to customers who were not specifically intending to visit the store but were attracted by its visible, high-footfall location."
 }
